  "body": "23 Paritai Drive Orakei, Auckland, an opportunity to acquire an exceptional landholding in one of New Zealand’s premium locations. This 979 sq.m sun-drenched site offers a north easterly aspect with unrestricted views across Auckland Harbour, Okahu Bay and nearby parkland.\r\n\r\nPositioned to capture wide, protected-feeling vistas across the harbour, current zoning allows you to significantly maximize these elevated sea views whether you choose to rebuild or reimagine. Held by the same family for 30 years (across two generations), opportunities to buy a site of this calibre in this location are extremely rare.\r\n\r\nCurrently configured for multi-generational living (8 bedrooms, 2 ensuites, 3 bathrooms, 2 dining rooms, 4 lounges, and 4 car garaging plus), it can be redesigned to suit a single family with all the amenities you could possibly\r\nwant on site with no space constraints.\r\n\r\nMoments from the Auckland CBD, Heliport, Okahu Marina as well as Auckland’s finest beaches and leading schools, this is an opportunity not to be missed in this tightly held location.\r\n\r\nResidence 1 (23A) - approximately 376 sq.m floor area\r\nResidence 2 (23B) – approximately 249 sq.m floor area\r\n\r\nBring your imagination and your architect to visualise your future.",
